    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The landscape around Kimberly still bears subtle marks from past coal mining, visible in the altered contours of the creek valley.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/kimberly_fayette_county_west_virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Kimberly lies within the New River Gorge region, near the New River Gorge National Park and Preserve, a UNESCO World Heritage Site.",
